            "speakerName": "(test)摸鱼研究员$UNRELEASED",
            "text": "（test）我已经申请到了洞窟塔的紧急备用钥匙，咱们去洞窟塔回收数据吧 $UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740410302"
            ]
          },
          "740410302": {
            "id": "740410302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（test）怎么是备用？ $UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740410303"
            ]
          },
          "740410303": {
